; Rendered by matugen (ThemeEngine) into
; ~/.config/qt{5,6}ct/colors/matugen.conf on every wallpaper/mode change.
; qt{5,6}ct.conf must select it via color_scheme_path with custom_palette=true
; (Fusion style honours the custom palette). Qt reads it at app launch, no
; live recolour, Qt has no palette hot-reload.
; Row order (qt5ct/qt6ct palette serialization): WindowText, Button, Light,
; Midlight, Dark, Mid, Text, BrightText, ButtonText, Base, Window, Shadow,
; Highlight, HighlightedText, Link, LinkVisited, AlternateBase, ToolTipBase,
; ToolTipText, PlaceholderText, Accent.
